.TH PTRACE_VALUE 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
ptrace_value \- invoke ptrace with integer data
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/ptrace.h>
.B long ptrace_value(long request, pid_t process, void *address, unsigned long data);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes Linux ptrace with integer data, for example a word for PTRACE_POKEDATA
or a signal for PTRACE_CONT.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ptrace (3crunch),
.BR ptrace (2)
